<b>To:</b> Ed Barberini &lt;ebarberini@cityofsanmateo.org&gt;; Alex Khojikian &lt;akhojikian@cityofsanmateo.org&gt;; Laurie Strange &lt;strange@cityofsanmateo.org&gt;; Martin McTaggart &lt;mmctaggart@cityofsanmateo.org&gt;<br>
<b>Subject:</b> Axon briefing for council<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Good morning all, Axon would like to come out to San Mateo to do an in-person executive presentation on the Axon technology and ALPR&#8217;s. They are looking at some dates next week or the following week. Attached is a sample of how we can structure
 the day with up to two council members at a time. This would be a great opportunity for our city leaders to ask any questions they might have, and they will be hearing directly from Axon. If I could have some help with times and dates that work best with council
 I will work to confirm with Axon. Please let me know if you have any questions or need any further information. Thank you for your support.
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Anthony<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
